    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n愚者棋局为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成8人队伍参与匹配。进入愚者棋局玩法后，所有非凡者<Highlight>挑选棋子出场战斗</>，并通过<Highlight>凑齐羁绊、提升棋子星级</>来提升强度，最终击败所有对手。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获胜条件</>\n进入玩法后，淘汰的非凡者可以继续留在场上<Highlight>旁观</>其他非凡者。非凡者需要通过棋子对战，击败其他所有非凡者的棋子阵容，才能取得对局胜利。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>组队规则</>\n多人组队时，将按照<Highlight>队伍内最高段位非凡者</>的水平开始匹配。若组队人数大于等于6人，则非凡者无法获得胜点。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nFool's Gambit is a team competition gameplay where up to 8 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. After entering Шут's Gambit gameplay, all Потустороннийs <Highlight>choose chess pieces to fight</> and increase their strength by <Highlight>collecting bonds and upgrading the star level of the chess pieces</>, eventually defeating all opponents. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning conditions </>\nAfter entering the gameplay, eliminated Потустороннийs can remain on the field to <Highlight>spectate</> other Потустороннийs. Потустороннийs need to use chess piece battles to defeat the chess piece lineups of all other Потустороннийs to win the match. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Team formation rules </>\nWhen forming a team with multiple people, matchmaking will begin according to the level of the <Highlight>highest-ranked Потусторонний in the team</>. If the number of people in the team is 6 or more, Потустороннийs cannot obtain victory points.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Beyonder's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Потусторонний's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality.",
